          }
        },
        "text_rJMFWJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Heavenly Essentials are made using 100%<strong> GOTS certified </strong>(Global Organic Textile Standard)<strong> </strong>Linen, certified in the EU and US. We also offer European Flax Certified, 100% linen items. All of our flax is grown, spun and processed in Europe.</p><p>We sew all our garments in Los Angeles (USA), with sustainably sourced, 100% linen thread.</p>",
