    "section_double_jf9qdN": {
      "type": "section-double",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_tWgBd4": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Premium, Regenerative Fabrics",
            "text_size": 8,
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "text_QqGVrr": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We exclusively source and only use the highest quality European flax the world has to offer, from regenerative farms in France and Belgium. Our flax is grown organically and regeneratively in Europe (according to GOTS standards), to produce the highest quality linen fabric. The European region’s rich soil and Northern Sea climate are the perfect conditions for growing vibrant, mineral-rich crops, that produces increased lignans; the unique healing compound, found only in linen fabric. When compared to conventionally grown linen, organic linen can have up to ten times the amount of skin-healing lignans!</p><p>All our products are sewn with 100% linen thread. Our flax-based elastics are made from linen and natural tree rubber (from Fair-trade farms) and contain zero synthetics/no plastic at all.</p><p><strong>Our collections embody a new standard in sustainable fashion—where beauty, integrity, and environmental care are seamlessly intertwined.</strong></p>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        }
      },
