          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>All of our raw materials and textiles are grown and manufactured in Europe. The European textile industry is world-renowned for its craftsmanship, luxury and sustainability-focus.  </p><p>We design and sew all our pieces in the USA, ensuring the highest ethical standards and procedures. We are committed to a fully transparent production process, free of child-labor or any unethical practices. </p>",
