    "section_double_Hk8Fbj": {
      "type": "section-double",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_TXqNME": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Plastic-Free, Eco-Luxe Details",
            "text_size": 8,
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "text_EkjDVb": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Heavenly Essentials redefines luxury with a commitment to sustainability and elegant craftsmanship. All of our products are completely plastic-free. Our product range includes thoughtfully designed, real mother of pearl, biblical gemstones and copper metal details- creating timeless sophistication from genuine, organic materials. </p><p>Wearing real copper is renowned for its ability to support the body's magnetic and bio-energy field, and offers natural antimicrobial properties when in contact with the skin. We are committed to adding an elevated touch to each piece of intimate wear, without compromising on comfort or sustainability.</p><p>We believe true luxury lies in conscious choices. By replacing synthetic elements with natural alternatives, we deliver eco-friendly elegance, that supports both your body and the Planet.</p>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        }
