        "text_btqcCk": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>All of our <strong>products and packaging</strong> are completely plant-based and plastic-free.  Our paper tags and printed materials are <strong>tree-free</strong>, and made from cotton, hemp, grass and/or sugarcane. Not only are your Heavenlies biodegradable and compostable - but so are all of the packaging materials! All of our inks are plant-based, non-toxic and Oeko-Tex certified, including the tagless labels on the inside of our underwear. Our labels are made from linen and natural vegetable inks.</p>",
